        <header class="post-header">

            <p class="post-meta">July 27, 2026 • Blog, Services</p>
            <h1 class="post-title">What You Need to Know About Self Drive Car Rental</h1>
            <p>
                Drive your car in Davao. Self Drive rentals is getting popular these days in the city due to the added convenience and privacy.
                Also, with the development of modern navigation tools, such as Waze and Google maps, travelers gained confidence and desire roaming the city by their own.
            </p>
            <div class="section-images">
                <img src="~/Pages/Articles/Self-Drive-What-to-Know/Images/Self-drive-Innova.webp" />
                <img src="~/Pages/Articles/Self-Drive-What-to-Know/Images/Self-drive-Innova-red.webp" />
