                <img src="~/Pages/Articles/Self-Drive-What-to-Know/Images/Self-drive-seats.jpg" />
            </div>
        </header>

        <div>
            <h3>
                Self Drive Car Rental Rates
            </h3>
            <p>
                Daily rate starts at P2,500 for a sedan car, P3,000 for MPVs, and P3,500 for SUVs, for city limit drives. 
                Price varies for destinations outside city areas. Special rates for long term rentals (weekly, monthly) and returning clients.
            </p>

        </div>

        <section class="contact">
